<title>USA: HealthSouth shareholders ok stock split.</title>
<headline>HealthSouth shareholders ok stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthSouth Corp said Thursday that its stockholders have approved its previously announced two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company's board announced the split in January. The split, to be effected in the form of a stock dividend, is payable March 17 to holders of record March 13, the company said.</p>
<p>The move increases the company's common stock to 500 million shares from 250 million shares.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
